msgid "入门"
msgstr "Getting Started"

msgid "在[GitHub](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend)上fork Triton-Ascend代码库。"
msgstr "Fork the Triton-Ascend repository on [GitHub](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend)."

msgid "阅读[README.md](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/blob/main/README.md)获取项目信息和构建开发环境。"
msgstr "Read [README.md](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/blob/main/README.md) for project information and building the development environment."

msgid "开发者来源认证"
msgstr "Developer Source Certification"

msgid "所有提交需包含 `Signed-off-by:` 行，使用 `git commit -s` 自动添加："
msgstr "All submissions must include a `Signed-off-by:` line, which can be added automatically using `git commit -s`:"

msgid "git commit -s -m \"your commit message\"\\n"
msgstr "git commit -s -m \"your commit message\""

msgid "这会在提交信息末尾自动添加一行 `Signed-off-by: Your Name <your.email@example.com>`，表明你确认该贡献的来源和授权。"
msgstr "This will automatically add a line `Signed-off-by: Your Name <your.email@example.com>` at the end of the commit message, indicating that you confirm the origin and authorization of the contribution."

